<title>USA: Decatur, Ala., won by Regions Investment.</title>
<headline>Decatur, Ala., won by Regions Investment.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Regions Investment Co, Inc said it won $31.175 million of Decatur, Ala., various general obligation warrants, Series 1997, with a net interest cost of 4.982 percent.</p>
</text>
